        <item>
            <title>1.44</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>What's new in 1.44</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Commission rules</b> &mdash; per-user setup, with an earnings preview for reps.</li>
<li><b>Resizable &amp; hideable</b> columns on the clients list.</li>
<li><b>Quick Estimate</b> &mdash; start a proposal without a client.</li>
<li><b>Materials tab</b> for custom items.</li>
<li><b>Owner initials</b> line on item PDFs.</li>
<li>Smarter <b>required logic</b> &mdash; nested conditions and per-item unit type.</li>
<li>Reworked refund screen, more accurate PDF totals, iPad list polish, more reliable sign-in.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
